---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Brand from '../components/Brand.astro';
import ContactBand from '../components/ContactBand.astro';
import Video from '../components/Video.astro';
const specs=[['Maximum payload','300 kg / 661 lb'],['Base dimensions (L × W × H)','835 × 500 × 1,350 mm'],['Maximum travel speed','1.2 m/s'],['Runtime at full load','8 hours'],['Runtime without load','12 hours'],['Charge time, 0–90%','2 hours'],['Navigation','VSLAM + LiDAR SLAM']];
---
<Base title="Our robots" description="Explore the compact mobile robot platform behind packsel, its shelf configurations, and reference specifications.">
<div class="interior">
<section class="page-hero"><p class="page-eyebrow">Meet the hardware.</p><h1>A new kind<br />of workhorse.</h1><p class="page-deck">The mobile platform behind <Brand tm />.<br />Configured for the work your floor needs.</p></section>
<section class="content-wrap split-feature"><figure class="product-surface" data-reveal><img src="/images/transport-robot.webp" width="800" height="1200" alt="packsel platform robot with a compact mobile base, mast, and touchscreen" fetchpriority="high" /><figcaption>Product visualization · Platform configuration</figcaption></figure><div class="feature-copy" data-reveal><p class="page-eyebrow">Platform transport.</p><h2>A compact base.<br />A useful daily role.</h2><p>A loading platform and an onboard touchscreen for point-to-point material transport.</p><div class="spec-strip"><div><strong>300 kg</strong><span>Maximum payload</span></div><div><strong>1.2 m/s</strong><span>Maximum speed</span></div><div><strong>8 h</strong><span>Full-load runtime*</span></div></div><p class="note">Standard-platform reference specifications. Runtime varies with load, route, and operating conditions. Final specifications are confirmed in your proposal.</p><div class="page-actions" style="justify-content:flex-start"><a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:zach@packsel.co?subject=Robot%20configuration%20enquiry">Find your configuration</a></div></div></section>
<section class="content-wrap page-section"><div class="section-intro" data-reveal><p class="page-eyebrow">Shelf transport.</p><h2>More on board.<br />Less back and forth.</h2><p>Multi-level shelves keep products and totes organized on the way between workstations.</p></div><figure class="media-frame" data-reveal><img src="/images/factory-shelf-robot.webp" srcset="/images/factory-shelf-robot-800.webp 800w, /images/factory-shelf-robot.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width:1264px) calc(100vw - 64px), 1200px" width="1600" height="900" alt="packsel shelf robot carrying cartons and totes on a factory floor" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Illustrative shelf configuration. Final hardware may differ.</figcaption></figure><div class="split-feature" style="margin-top:48px"><div class="feature-copy" data-reveal><h2>Give every order<br />its own place.</h2><p>A picking configuration can pair separate bins with a scan-guided workflow.</p></div><div class="feature-copy" data-reveal><p>Our interactive demo uses nine order bins to illustrate zone picking. Shelf arrangements and software workflows are defined around your requirements.</p><a class="page-link" href="/warehouse-demo/">Explore the picking concept</a></div></div></section>
<section class="neutral-band page-section"><div class="content-wrap split-feature"><div class="feature-copy" data-reveal><p class="page-eyebrow">Under the surface.</p><h2>Know the platform.</h2><p>Reference specifications for standard transport. Payload dimensions and accessories affect the clearance your floor needs.</p></div><div class="spec-panel" data-reveal><table class="spec-table"><caption class="visually-hidden">Standard transport platform reference specifications</caption><tbody>{specs.map(([label,value])=><tr><th scope="row">{label}</th><td>{value}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table><p class="note">Reference: supplied product specification, December 2025. Ratings are not a site-specific performance guarantee.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="content-wrap page-section split-feature"><div class="feature-copy" data-reveal><p class="page-eyebrow">See it move.</p><h2>Made for<br />the daily trip.</h2><p>Watch the platform navigate and carry materials between work areas.</p></div><div data-reveal><Video /></div></section>
<ContactBand />
</div>
</Base>
